@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-03
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-03 v2. SysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed
' Approved figlib candidate v2 mapped to controlled ids. Not a proof of equivalence.
component TE
' entity TE: «block» / Test / t ∈ T(q_k);  cost(t) ≥ c_{min}
component OB
' entity OB: «block» / Observation / I_k, observable summary q_k; / ERROR if instrument invalid
component AN
' entity AN: «block» / Analysis / constraint verdict; / same partitions as scoring
component DI
' entity DI: «block» / Diagnosis / candidate set H_k; / compatibility update
component SE
' entity SE: «block» / Selection / one-step min-max s(t); / PREP / RECOVER actions
component EV
' entity EV: «block» / Evidence / traces, stop class, / resource remainder
TE --> OB : a1 execute
OB --> AN : a2 I_k
AN --> DI : a3 compatible / / inconsistent
DI --> SE : a4 remaining H_k
SE --> TE : a5 next TEST, / PREP or stop
EV ..> OB : d1
EV ..> SE : d2
EV ..> DI : d3
note as NT
  Blocks are logical classifiers, not implemented modules.
end note
note as legend
  Legend: directed association; «trace» dependency; analysis core
end note
@enduml
